#abstract[
  We construct two distinct Leray--Hopf solutions with generalised diffusion
  $m(nabla)$ given by $m(r)=r^(alpha) ell(r)$, where $alpha=5/4$.
  The parameter $ell$ is slowly varying and $ell in L^2 ((1,oo);(dif r)/r)$.
  $
    partial_t u+u dot.op nabla u+nabla p+frac((-Delta)^(5/4),log(e+(-Delta)^(1/2))^q)u=f,
    quad nabla dot.op u=0.
  $
]
